flowchart TB
    UI["Browser dashboard<br/>Live · Historical archive · Simulated demo<br/>map · table · four charts · coverage · comparison · trends · estimates"]
    API["FastAPI · api.py<br/>dashboard, history, climate, model APIs"]
    SVC["dashboard_service.py<br/>live request: 31-day cap · short-lived cache<br/>archive query: selected UTC date window"]
    NASA["NASA POWER Daily point API<br/>T2M · RH2M · WS10M · PRECTOTCORR<br/>UTC · grid-cell estimates"]
    NORM["Normalize and validate<br/>WS10M: m/s × 3.6 → km/h<br/>fill/missing values remain null"]
    LIVE["Live dashboard response<br/>source metadata · latest values · prototype rule levels"]
    DEMO["Bundled labelled demo observations"]
    RULES["Prototype threshold rules<br/>not official warnings or disaster predictions"]
    INCIDENTS["Simulated/prototype incident panel<br/>does not contact emergency services"]
    INGEST["Retry-safe historical ingestion<br/>71 NASA POWER requests · raw gzip + SHA-256 retained"]
    DB["SQLite schema v3 archive<br/>446,364 daily-variable observations<br/>12 countries × 4 variables · zero missing values"]
    HIST["Historical queries<br/>location · variable · UTC date range · daily resolution"]
    SUM["Deterministic graph summaries<br/>computed from the exact plotted observations"]
    CMP["climate_analysis.py<br/>shared-range comparison · seasonal summaries<br/>extrema · completeness warnings · rankings"]
    TREND["Annual trends<br/>complete calendar years only<br/>OLS per year and per decade · descriptive"]
    SUITE["climate_model_suite.py<br/>48 one-day models · 12 locations × 4 variables<br/>chronological splits · gated intervals"]
    ARCHIVE["Historical dashboard response<br/>observations, comparisons and estimates kept distinct"]
    CARTO["CARTO basemap tiles<br/>map background only · not NASA data"]

    UI --> API --> SVC
    SVC -->|Live mode| NASA --> NORM --> LIVE
    SVC -->|Simulated demo| DEMO --> RULES
    NORM --> RULES --> INCIDENTS --> LIVE
    NASA -->|History retained| INGEST --> DB --> HIST
    SVC -->|Archive mode| HIST
    HIST --> SUM --> ARCHIVE
    HIST --> CMP --> TREND --> ARCHIVE
    HIST --> SUITE --> ARCHIVE
    LIVE --> UI
    ARCHIVE --> UI
    CARTO --> UI

